    "text": "Item in the actions menu of a knowledge base in the AI Chat section; opens the info panel with its details and members. Noun phrase, not a verb. Short menu label, no full stop. Knowledge base = a room of files the AI assistant searches; never call it a room. Match Common:CreateKnowledgeBase.",
    "is_auto": true,
    "updated_at": "2026-11-21T13:04:52.624Z",
    "model": "claude-fable-5-2"
  },
